+{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01QMdQAzSpY1zaTCGDUUzwPv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Dic2WDKsDv4w5ez2LwYb5Z","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/workspace/CONTRACT.md","content":"# CONTRACT — E-Commerce Backend\n\nDefinition of done. Every box must pass via `npm test`, plus `npm run build` and `npm run lint` clean.\n\n## Module / build conventions\n- [ ] tsconfig uses `module: Node16` ESM → all relative imports use explicit `.js` extensions.\n- [ ] No service imports another service (only `../bus.js` + `../types.js`).\n- [ ] `src/index.ts` re-exports all 8 factory functions.\n- [ ] `npm run build` compiles cleanly.\n- [ ] `npm run lint` reports no errors.\n\n## Catalog — `createCatalogService(bus)`\n- [ ] `createProduct` returns a unique non-empty id and stores the product → `getProduct(id)` returns `{id,name,price,category}`.\n- [ ] `createProduct` emits `PRODUCT_CREATED` with `{productId,name,price,category}`.\n- [ ] `getProduct` returns `null` for unknown id.\n- [ ] `listProducts()` returns all products; `listProducts(category)` returns only that category.\n- [ ] `searchProducts(query)` matches product name case-insensitively (substring); empty query → all.\n- [ ] `updateProduct(id, {price})` updates only given fields; unknown id is a no-op.\n- [ ] `removeProduct(id)` returns true when removed (and getProduct→null after), false for unknown id.\n\n## Inventory — `createInventoryService(bus)`\n- [ ] `setStock` sets quantity and emits `INVENTORY_UPDATED {productId,quantity}`.\n- [ ] `getStock` returns current quantity, `0` for unknown product.\n- [ ] `reserve` returns false and does not change stock when insufficient.\n- [ ] `reserve` returns true, decrements stock, emits `INVENTORY_UPDATED` when sufficient.\n- [ ] `release` increments stock back and emits `INVENTORY_UPDATED`.\n- [ ] `setLowStockThreshold` + stock dropping below threshold emits `LOW_STOCK_ALERT {productId,currentQuantity,threshold}`.\n- [ ] No alert when no threshold configured (default disabled).\n\n## Cart — `createCartService(bus)`\n- [ ] `createCart` returns unique id; `getCart` returns `{id,userId,items:[]}`; unknown → null.\n- [ ] `addItem` adds line; adding same product again consolidates (sums quantity).\n- [ ] `addItem`/`removeItem`/`updateQuantity`/`clearCart` each emit `CART_UPDATED {cartId,userId,items}`.\n- [ ] `removeItem` removes the product line entirely.\n- [ ] `updateQuantity` sets exact quantity; quantity ≤ 0 removes the line; product not present + qty>0 adds it.\n- [ ] `clearCart` empties items.\n- [ ] non-positive `addItem` quantity is ignored.\n\n## Pricing — `createPricingService(bus)`\n- [ ] `calculateTotal` subtotal = Σ price*qty; tax = 10% of (subtotal − discount); total = subtotal − discount + tax.\n- [ ] `addDiscountCode(code,pct)` then calculateTotal with that code reduces subtotal before tax; discount = pct% of subtotal.\n- [ ] unknown / no discount code → discount 0.\n- [ ] all returned numbers rounded to 2 decimals.\n- [ ] `getPrice(productId)` returns price learned from `PRODUCT_CREATED` events; unknown → 0.\n\n## Orders — `createOrderService(bus)`\n- [ ] `createOrder` returns id, status `PENDING`, emits `ORDER_CREATED {orderId,userId,cartId,total}`.\n- [ ] `getOrder` returns `{id,userId,status,total}`; unknown → null.\n- [ ] `updateStatus` emits `ORDER_STATUS_CHANGED {orderId,status,previousStatus}`.\n- [ ] valid lifecycle enforced: pending→confirmed→shipped→delivered; pending/confirmed→cancelled; invalid transition throws and emits nothing.\n- [ ] updateStatus on unknown order throws.\n- [ ] `listOrders(userId)` returns that user's orders `{id,status,total}`.\n\n## Payment — `createPaymentService(bus, options?)`\n- [ ] default processPayment resolves `SUCCESS` with a transactionId, emits `PAYMENT_PROCESSED`.\n- [ ] options `{mode:'failure'}` → resolves `FAILED` with error, no transactionId, emits event.\n- [ ] options `{mode:'timeout'}` → resolves `TIMEOUT` with error, emits event.\n- [ ] `refund(txId)` returns true for a successful, not-yet-refunded transaction; false otherwise (unknown / already refunded / non-success).\n- [ ] processPayment is async (returns a Promise).\n\n## Notifications — `createNotificationService(bus)`\n- [ ] `subscribe(userId)` then order/payment events for that user record notifications.\n- [ ] learns order→user mapping from `ORDER_CREATED`; resolves user for `ORDER_STATUS_CHANGED` & `PAYMENT_PROCESSED`.\n- [ ] `getNotifications(userId)` returns recorded `{type,message,timestamp}` list; emits `NOTIFICATION_SENT`.\n- [ ] unsubscribed users receive nothing.\n\n## Analytics — `createAnalyticsService(bus)`\n- [ ] `getEventCount(type)` counts events of that name seen on the bus.\n- [ ] `getRevenue()` sums order totals for successful payments (order total learned from `ORDER_CREATED`).\n- [ ] `getConversionRate()` = orders / unique carts (distinct cartIds seen via `CART_UPDATED`); 0 when no carts.\n- [ ] `getTopProducts(limit)` ranks products by ordered quantity (from cart items at order time), desc, limited.\n</content>\n</invoke>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":251,"cache_read_input_tokens":28612,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":251},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7aed3f47-5b3d-4721-bf21-a344cd933903","uuid":"b6de87d1-7e97-487f-aecd-6ee8768ecd1d","request_id":"req_011CbWWhQop92r4Jz3qj6s9b"}
